{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31943","headline":"长孙霞李溟自紫阁白阁二峯见访 · 贾岛","name":"长孙霞李溟自紫阁白阁二峯见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞吾庐贫，同来二阁人。\n所论唯野事，招作住云邻。\n古寺期秋宿，平林散早春。\n漱流今已矣，巢许岂尧臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}